WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.616
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: AI Writes Excel Formulas.

2
00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:11.971
Describe a task and get a working formula. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.983 --> 00:00:19.737
Step one. Describe your columns and what you want. For example, show Pass if the mark is fifty or more.

4
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.461
Step two. The AI gives a formula. Copy it.

5
00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:31.376
Step three. Paste it in Excel and test it with easy numbers, to see if the answer is right.

6
00:00:32.383 --> 00:00:38.533
Step four. If you see an error, tell the AI the error message. It can help you fix the formula.

7
00:00:39.517 --> 00:00:43.423
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:43.723 --> 00:00:46.454
Ask AI for a formula that adds column B.

9
00:00:46.754 --> 00:00:49.578
Ask for an IF formula for Pass or Fail.

10
00:00:49.878 --> 00:00:52.435
Test both formulas with easy numbers.

11
00:00:52.735 --> 00:00:53.770
Well done!

